{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35893","headline":"草檄荅南蛮有咏 · 胡曾","name":"草檄荅南蛮有咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辞天出塞阵云空，雾卷霞开万里通。\n亲受虎符安宇宙，誓将龙剑定英雄。\n残霜敢冒高悬日，秋叶争禁大段风。\n爲报南蛮须屏迹，不同蜀将武侯功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}